*======================================================================*
* GPSS DATA PROCESSING UTILITY - REPORTER LOGIC                   *
*======================================================================*

BLOCKSIZE 80

title  DATA_REPORTER_MODULE

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 1. REPORTING STAGE                                               *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* Transactions arrive from Processor (simulated by initial generate)*
   GENERATE    -1,,100       * 100 processed records

* Check-in to Reporter Facility                                *
   ENTER       REPORTER_F

* Count the transactions                                         *
   COUNT       TOTAL_RECORDS

* Simulate Writing Report                                        *
* In GPSS, this is often done via FILE statements in extensions  *
* or by logging to standard output if supported by the specific  *
* GPSS implementation. Here we just wait a bit to simulate I/O.  *
   BLOCK       10

* Check-out from Facility                                      *
   LEAVE       REPORTER_F

* End Simulation                                                 *
   TERMINATE     0

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 2. FACILITIES & QUEUES                                         *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
   FACILITY    REPORTER_F
   COUNT       TOTAL_RECORDS

   START       1

END
